Usage of assemble:
  -cases string
    	caller native cases with expected outputs
  -compiler string
    	Gooo compiler executable with body-context --model (default "gooo")
  -entry string
    	activity name to assemble
  -json
    	emit the complete machine-readable report; originals are always saved
  -model string
    	optional local record model or builtin; omission is deterministic
  -out string
    	new output directory containing result, generated Go and original records
  -source string
    	Gooo source with one record assembling activity
